app.use(express.urlencoded({ extended: true, limit: '10kb' }));
```

### 2.2 Enhanced Security Headers (Optional)

For stricter security, replace the basic helmet() with the enhanced configuration:

```javascript
// Replace app.use(helmet()); with:
app.use(helmet.contentSecurityPolicy({
  directives: {
